  partName: Valve Cover
  description: The Valve Cover, situated at the middle-center-center of the engine,
    is a small, complex, metal-bright component that protects and encloses the engine's
    valves and valve train. Its complex shape and metal-bright material provide exceptional
    strength and durability, which are essential for withstanding the high stresses
    and temperatures generated by the engine. Notably, the Valve Cover's position
    at the center of the engine enables it to work in tandem with other components
    to maintain engine performance and efficiency.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
